md('## Poisoned evidence and citation manipulation\n\nContent hashes can reject changed registered evidence. They cannot establish the truth of a correctly registered submission. Citation validity checks source membership only; valid source IDs may still accompany unsupported answers. No model judge supplies truth labels.')
