code("reconciliation = read('reconciliation.json')\nassert reconciliation['metrics_rebuilt_from_attempt_ids']\nassert all(read(f'{s}-run.json')['attempts'] == reconciliation['stages'][s]['n'] for s in ['development','evaluation','positions','ingestion','adaptive'])\nprint(reconciliation)")
md('## Conclusions and limitations\n\nThe evidence applies to these fixed local attacks, small task samples and two compact generators. Authorization can be enforced outside the model under the stated trusted-registry assumptions. Statistical generation defenses can bypass, over-reject or damage useful evidence. No result establishes general prompt-injection robustness, unknown-secret protection, production authentication, faithful citation entailment or resilience against unrestricted adaptive attackers. The final README reports verified numerical outcomes, uncertainty and costs.')
